# The gRPC client variation point attaches to the base plateau: it adds the
# fixed client code, the consumed contract and its generated code, the todo
# API's adapter and emulator, the service over it, and the command that uses
# it, and changes only these base files: the composition root, the command
# registry and the runner of its scenarios, and the module's dependency,
# build, and readme files.
base library/architecture/go/base-plateau-in-go.skill/examples
change cmd/todo/main.go
change internal/command/handlers.go
change internal/command/test/runner_test.go
change go.mod
change go.sum
change Makefile
change README.md
# The todo API's adapter is written per API: the HTTP and the gRPC client
# examples each show their own. The service over it checks only the outcomes
# of client/core/outcome, the same for both.
sample internal/infrastructure/client/todoapi/*
